<title>UK: Commerbank sets warrants on German blue chips.</title>
<headline>Commerbank sets warrants on German blue chips.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG has issued 220 million American-style call and put warrants, in 22 equal tranches, on a basket of German blue chips, lead manager Commerz Financial Products said.</p>
<p>The basket comprises BASF AG, Daimler-Benz AG, Deutsche Telekom AG, Dresdner Bank AG, Hoechst AG and VEBA AG.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 02.FEB.97-18.MAR.98   PAYDATE	28.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
